<title>RUSSIA: Aeroflot details 1996 traffic.</title>
<headline>Aeroflot details 1996 traffic.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's main international carrier Aeroflot-Russian International Airlines gave details on Thursday of traffic carried on its internatinal and domestic scheduled and charter flights in 1996.</p>
<p>					   1996	 1995</p>
<p>    Passengers carried (mln)	3.8	  3.5</p>
<p>    Passenger load factor (pct)  60.9	 58.9</p>
<p>    Flights			  49,900     48,383</p>
<p>    Total hours flown	   170,372    165,362</p>
<p>Aeroflot did not give total operating revenues, profit or other financial data for 1996 in the statement made available to Reuters.</p>
<p>The statement said Aeroflot accounted for 18 percent of 1996 total passenger and cargo turnover in Russia and 60 percent of passenger volumes on international flights by Russian carriers.</p>
<p>-- Viktor Anoshkin, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
